---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact Us | Net Worth Calculator by Age" description="Get in touch with the NetWorth team for feedback or data inquiries.">
	<main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
		<header class="text-center mb-12 space-y-2">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">Contact Us</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400">Have feedback or data suggestions? We'd love to hear from you.</p>
		</header>

		<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl">
			<form class="space-y-6" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Thank you! Your message has been received.');">
				<div>
					<label for="contact-name" class="block text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-2">Your Name</label>
					<input id="contact-name" type="text" required class="w-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-white rounded-xl px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-500 font-medium" placeholder="John Doe">
				</div>

				<div>
					<label for="contact-email" class="block text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-2">Email Address</label>
					<input id="contact-email" type="email" required class="w-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-white rounded-xl px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-500 font-medium" placeholder="john@example.com">
				</div>

				<div>
					<label for="contact-message" class="block text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 mb-2">Message</label>
					<textarea id="contact-message" rows="4" required class="w-full bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-white rounded-xl px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-500 font-medium" placeholder="How can we help?"></textarea>
				</div>

				<button type="submit" class="w-full py-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold text-base transition-all shadow-md">
					Send Message
				</button>
			</form>
		</div>
	
    <!-- Contact & Editorial Desk Details -->
    <section class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-8 mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Get in Touch with Our Financial Engineering Desk</h2>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator is maintained by a global team of financial analysts, software developers, and quantitative data researchers. We welcome user feedback, dataset correction requests, press inquiries, and strategic partnership proposals.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">Primary Support & Inquiry Channels</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Official Email Support:</strong> support@getnetworthcalculator.com</li>
        <li><strong>Data Research Inquiries:</strong> research@getnetworthcalculator.com</li>
        <li><strong>Response Time Commitment:</strong> Our team reviews and responds to user inquiries within 24 to 48 business hours.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">Frequently Asked Support Questions</h3>
      <p><strong>1. How often are wealth percentile datasets updated?</strong><br />Datasets are refreshed immediately following major triennial releases from the US Federal Reserve (SCF), UK ONS, and Statistics Canada.</p>
      <p><strong>2. Can I request custom country net worth benchmarks?</strong><br />Yes! Send your country request and official central bank data sources to support@getnetworthcalculator.com and our data team will prioritize it.</p>
    </section>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">Data Protection & User Privacy Commitment</h3>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator adheres to strict global data protection practices including General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) standards. Because all calculator operations take place client-side inside your local browser, your private balance sheet inputs are never stored or logged on our infrastructure.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you discover a data anomaly or wish to recommend additional dataset updates from the Federal Reserve, ONS, or Statistics Canada, please submit your feedback to support@getnetworthcalculator.com.
      </p>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">Why Millions of Users Trust Get Net Worth Calculator</h3>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator provides transparent, zero-login, client-side wealth percentiles. Whether you are tracking personal net worth milestones in your 20s, 30s, 40s, or 50s, or benchmarking against official central bank statistics (US Federal Reserve, UK ONS, Statistics Canada), our mission is to deliver fast, accurate, and private financial tools without subscription fees or data collection.
      </p>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">Global Wealth Percentile Standards</h3>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator adheres to modern web standards, W3C accessibility guidelines, and fast Core Web Vitals responsiveness. Whether calculating liquid net worth, analyzing retirement readiness, or benchmarking household balance sheets against central bank surveys (US Federal Reserve SCF, UK ONS, Statistics Canada SFS), our platform delivers instant, reliable financial modeling with zero data tracking.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our financial data team regularly audits central bank benchmark tables to reflect revised inflation adjustments, housing market indices, and wage percentile figures. If you have questions regarding our mathematical models or research methodology, contact our support desk anytime at support@getnetworthcalculator.com. Thank you for choosing Get Net Worth Calculator! We appreciate your trust in our financial data platform and calculators. We look forward to assisting you.
      </p>

  </main>
</Layout>
